# Overlays (Modal / SideSheet)

Never invent a custom `screen-form` / full-page dialog for new flows. Use the shared components.

## Choose the pattern

| Use | Component | Examples |
|-----|-----------|----------|
| Long form / map / calendar / multi-step | `Modal` (`components/Modal.tsx`) | Cliente alta/edición, cerrar visita, ficha, programar visita, asignar ruta, venta |
| Short action (few fields or confirm) | `SideSheet` (`components/SideSheet.tsx`) | Abono, ingreso/ajuste stock, quitar de ruta, asignar vendedor (dropdown) |

## Rules

- Always use dark full-screen scrim via `.app-overlay-backdrop` (covers sidebar).
- Prefer `FormStep` for multi-step body content.
- Put primary/cancel actions in the `footer` prop (`.side-sheet-actions`).
- Seller assignment on a client: single `<SelectField>` / `<select>`, not seller fichas.
- Do not reintroduce `size="lg"` / `aside` on SideSheet — long content belongs in Modal (`size="wide"` when needed).
- Hooks: `useBodyScrollLock` + `useEscapeKey` live in the shared components; don't duplicate.
- Nested overlays (ficha + wizard): Escape / backdrop close **only the top** overlay.
- Native file picker / camera: do **not** treat cancel, Escape, or the ghost click after the picker as `onClose`. The form stays mounted with its state.
- `PhotoDrop`: tap **Subir foto** abre hoja Galería / Cámara (trasera). No abrir selfie. Cancelar no cierra el wizard.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — full-page overlay
<div className="screen-form">…</div>

// ✅ GOOD — long form
<Modal open={open} onClose={onClose} size="wide" title="…" footer={…}>…</Modal>

// ✅ GOOD — short action
<SideSheet open={open} onClose={onClose} title="…" footer={…}>…</SideSheet>
```
